---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
const breadcrumbs=[{label:'Career',href:'/careers/'}];
const roles=[
 ['Trip Planning & Operations','Experienced travel professionals who understand itinerary design, supplier coordination, group operations, and traveler communication.'],
 ['Destination Specialists','People with deep practical knowledge of destinations, logistics, operators, languages, and local travel realities.'],
 ['Guides & Activity Specialists','Qualified professionals in trekking, mountaineering, diving, sailing, skiing, wilderness skills, culture, or other trip-specific disciplines.'],
 ['Group Hosts & Community Travel','People experienced in leading groups, traveler care, community dynamics, and keeping a trip moving without making it rigid.'],
 ['Travel Content & Field Documentation','Writers, photographers, and content specialists who can turn real planning knowledge and trip experience into useful public resources.']
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Careers & Specialist Network | Talon Expeditions" description="Career and specialist-network information for travel planners, destination specialists, guides, instructors, group hosts, and field-content professionals interested in Talon Expeditions." image={images.road} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <section class="av-inner-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.road}')`}><div class="shell"><h1>Career</h1><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="av-career-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">Join Our Journey</p><h2>Build Travel With People Who Understand Both Experience and Operations</h2></div><div class="av-career-contact"><small>Specialist network & future opportunities</small><a href="mailto:sales@talonexpeditions.com?subject=Specialist%20Network">sales@talonexpeditions.com</a></div></div><div class="av-why-image" style={`background-image:url('${images.group}')`}></div></div></section>
  <section class="section" style="background:var(--av-soft)"><div class="shell"><div class="av-services-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Future Opportunities</p><h2>Areas Where the Talon Network Can Grow</h2><p>We are not presenting these as currently open salaried positions. Qualified travel and activity professionals can introduce themselves for future staff, contractor, supplier, guide, instructor, host, or destination-network opportunities.</p></div><div class="av-job-list">{roles.map((role)=><div class="av-job-row"><div><span class="av-status">Expression of interest</span><h3>{role[0]}</h3></div><p>{role[1]}</p><div class="av-job-action"><div class="av-job-meta"><span>Future</span><span>Project / network</span></div><a class="button button-small" href={`mailto:sales@talonexpeditions.com?subject=${encodeURIComponent('Specialist Network: '+role[0])}`}>Introduce Yourself</a></div></div>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="av-proof-band" style={`background-image:url('${images.trekking}')`}><div class="shell"><div class="av-proof-head"><p class="eyebrow">What We Value</p><h2>Practical capability matters more than a generic travel-industry pitch.</h2></div><div class="av-proof-grid"><div class="av-proof-card"><h3>Destination Knowledge</h3><p>Explain where you actually operate, the routes or communities you know, and the logistical realities you can solve.</p><small>Local capability</small></div><div class="av-proof-card"><h3>Relevant Qualifications</h3><p>For technical activities, include licenses, certifications, professional memberships, insurance, and operating scope where applicable.</p><small>Specialist work</small></div><div class="av-proof-card"><h3>Group Experience</h3><p>Tell us what kinds of travelers and groups you work with, how you communicate, and what you are responsible for on the ground.</p><small>Operational fit</small></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
